==Trivia==
*Broton makes a few references to the ''[[wikipedia:Transformers|Transformers]]'' franchise:
**Its Japanese name, Planet Choibatron, sounds similar to [https://tfwiki.net/wiki/Cybertron_(planet) Cybertron], the Transformers' home planet.
**The yellow car on its base is reminiscent of [[wikipedia:Bumblebee (Transformers)|Bumblebee]], one of the franchise's major characters.
**Its [[Treasure]] in the Korean version is quite literally Transformers.

